### WU-2 — Repair the accept criterion defect
- **owner:** orchestrator (criteria are gate-owned) · **depends:** WU-1 · **blocks:** WU-3
- **in:** DESIGN §0 B4
- **do:** replace `rg -q '^loss_ratio: 0\.[0-9]+$'` with
  `rg -q '^loss_ratio: (0(\.[0-9]+)?|1(\.0+)?)$'`.
- **why:** the current regex rejects the two most decision-relevant outcomes — perfect extraction
  (`loss_ratio: 0`) and total extraction failure (`loss_ratio: 1`). The latter is the strongest possible
